:

>   Well, if that is how you use ordinarily use them, then you could do the=
 same with these.  (I assume that they are implicitly "stuck" with the most=
 recent qualifying sumti when you first use the BY, and until you use da'o?=
  I would find that a bit annoying, meself...)
